From: apklayer
Subject: [PATCH] Keep Choreographer on its display frame cadence

Base the next wakeup on the receiver's frame phase so scheduler delays do
not accumulate. Put frame deadlines and expected presentation times on the
same monotonic clock as the delivered vsync.

Against external/robolectric 87aa52b08 (REVISION), after 0024.
---
diff --git a/shadows/framework/src/main/java/org/robolectric/shadows/ShadowDisplayEventReceiver.java b/shadows/framework/src/main/java/org/robolectric/shadows/ShadowDisplayEventReceiver.java
--- a/shadows/framework/src/main/java/org/robolectric/shadows/ShadowDisplayEventReceiver.java
